          "**8.12.3.** In each following calendar month, Revenue Share Commission shall be calculated solely on the portion, if any, of that month's positive Net Revenue that remains after the Outstanding Negative Balance has first been deducted in full. Any part of the Outstanding Negative Balance not absorbed in a month shall roll forward again, month after month, with no time limit, until it has been reduced to zero. Any Negative Balance arising in a later month shall be added to the Outstanding Negative Balance.",
